  "details": "On the open beta, when EAC is badly initalised (aka something goes wrong somewhere but still manage to go through the launcher) for a reason or another (in my case I'm on Void Linux, that currently have a bug with EAC, like what was introduced with glibc 2.36), it now just leave you in the loading space after doing the logging to account.\n\nNo error message or nothing compared to Live that have an error message (a very obscure one tho, but do have one)",
